# Manual requests for the PhiChat API (Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code REST Client).
# Run the API with the "https" launch profile first.

@host = https://localhost:7146
@token = <paste the "token" from the login response>

### Sign in (sets the refresh-token cookie)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "your_username",
  "password": "your_password"
}

### Renew the access token using the refresh-token cookie
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh

### Current user
GET {{host}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Conversations
GET {{host}}/api/messages/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sign out (revokes the refresh token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
